[{:db/id "3882cc29-e493-5280-8251-94acc6ea11be" :answer/id #uuid "3882cc29-e493-5280-8251-94acc6ea11be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3+h)))-(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cc0c1ad0-0809-5caa-abd0-3c394f9b2ffc" :answer/id #uuid "cc0c1ad0-0809-5caa-abd0-3c394f9b2ffc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3+h)))-(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "142263e2-ffc1-5971-aab7-a78e8fb89d3d" :answer/id #uuid "142263e2-ffc1-5971-aab7-a78e8fb89d3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3)))-(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d6d16f5b-c575-532b-8e3a-633aa682efa9" :answer/id #uuid "d6d16f5b-c575-532b-8e3a-633aa682efa9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))-(\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3)))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6b6269b9-5085-5358-b7f7-9136abf836c0" :answer/id #uuid "6b6269b9-5085-5358-b7f7-9136abf836c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3)))+(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c0a173b9-7073-5910-96e4-56dae5d5791d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0a173b9-7073-5910-96e4-56dae5d5791d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["3882cc29-e493-5280-8251-94acc6ea11be" "cc0c1ad0-0809-5caa-abd0-3c394f9b2ffc" "142263e2-ffc1-5971-aab7-a78e8fb89d3d" "d6d16f5b-c575-532b-8e3a-633aa682efa9" "6b6269b9-5085-5358-b7f7-9136abf836c0"] :answer-field/correct "142263e2-ffc1-5971-aab7-a78e8fb89d3d" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "77fe6685-0db5-512c-a146-7a7385d90d5f" :question/id #uuid "77fe6685-0db5-512c-a146-7a7385d90d5f" :question/problem "Given that $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}(xy),$ express $f_x(2,3)$ as the limit of a difference quotient." :question/worked-solution "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit\n\n$$\nf_x(2,3)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{f(2+h, 3)-f(2,3)}{h}).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}(xy),$ we have that\n\n$$\nf(2+h, 3)=\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3)),\\qquad f(2,3)=\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nf_x(2,3)=\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(\\operatorname{sin}((2+h)(3)))-(\\operatorname{sin}((2)(3)))}{h}).\n$$\n\nHere $h\\ne 0$ before taking the limit, and $y=3$ is held constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["c0a173b9-7073-5910-96e4-56dae5d5791d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "9fcbe737-7d67-54f0-a0af-c34445d7c218" :answer/id #uuid "9fcbe737-7d67-54f0-a0af-c34445d7c218" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(-2(1+h)^{2}(1+h))-(-2(1)^{2}(1))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "aabfb2a7-9bda-52fd-af6a-cdfe4ba02cbd" :answer/id #uuid "aabfb2a7-9bda-52fd-af6a-cdfe4ba02cbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(-2(1+h)^{2}(1))+(-2(1)^{2}(1))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "632579ce-df9a-5c03-80b6-219fd7dfc7c7" :answer/id #uuid "632579ce-df9a-5c03-80b6-219fd7dfc7c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(-2(1)^{2}(1))-(-2(1+h)^{2}(1))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "54dcebd4-5b21-52a1-abea-45e80438c3b7" :answer/id #uuid "54dcebd4-5b21-52a1-abea-45e80438c3b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(-2(1+h)^{2}(1))-(-2(1)^{2}(1))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0f5e0c12-1df1-526a-96c6-ab0dd18cf612" :answer/id #uuid "0f5e0c12-1df1-526a-96c6-ab0dd18cf612" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{(-2(1)^{2}(1+h))-(-2(1)^{2}(1))}{h})" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "68616b5a-bbb9-56c3-8c1b-bdbfac656417" :answer-field/id #uuid "68